# the punch-ins: ENV Reverse, LFO Stutter, ARP Filter, SEQ Phaser; held: on, the knobs theirs (their page), back on
# letting go; a double tap latches one, a press turns it off
wait 3000
tap HOME
press ARP
wait 300
expect fx 4
expect view 12
spin K1 10
expect par43 35
release ARP
wait 300
expect fx 0
expect view 1
press ENV
press SEQ
wait 300
expect fx 9
release ENV
release SEQ
wait 300
tap LFO
tap LFO
wait 500
expect fx 2
tap LFO
wait 300
expect fx 0
